+        '${FuseSyncListView.buildCalls} items, '
+        '${us(FuseSyncListView.buildClock.elapsed, FuseSyncListView.buildCalls)} per item, '
+        'worst frame spent ${worstFrame.inMicroseconds / 1000} ms in JS builders');
