+  ///
+  /// ## How it works
+  /// - Runs on the **caller's thread** (the Dart isolate's thread; for a
+  ///   Flutter app that is the UI thread). It takes the runtime lock,
+  ///   blocking until any JS currently executing on a worker yields, then
+  ///   calls `globalThis[function](...params)` directly.
+  /// - Only the function body runs. Promise jobs and spawned futures it
