From 974742a665b375941d298dbbea0a14feed57d4a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:26:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(bridge): deadline-bounded sync call
 (try_call_global_sync)

The UI thread waits for a busy JS runtime for at most a budget (2 ms by
default, once per frame), then gets fuseJsBusy and shows a placeholder, so
a long JS task cannot stall a frame. The experimental sync list uses it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
